#MOBILE
Vnum       40201
Keywords   quan-jang quan jang master temple~
Short      Quan-Jang~
Long       Quan-Jang studies a bank of humming instruments, utterly absorbed.
~
Desc       Quan-Jang is a Je'daii Master of quiet, formidable intellect,
more comfortable among his instruments and star charts than in idle
conversation. He is said to understand the Force as well as anyone
alive - and to have looked further into its darker uses than most
would consider wise.
~
Race       Human~
Position   standing~
