#ROOM
Vnum     40201
Name     Gate of Anil Kesh~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     A narrow bridge of worked stone carries you across the edge of
the Chasm to Anil Kesh's gate. Wind moans up from the depths below,
carrying a chill no sunlight seems to reach. The Temple itself rises
ahead, more angular and precise in its architecture than anything
you've seen elsewhere on Tython.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40202
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    40208
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40931
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40202
Name     Hall of Instruments~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Brass and glass instruments of every size fill this long hall,
humming, ticking, and occasionally emitting small puffs of colored
vapor. None of it looks decorative. Everything here is in constant,
careful use.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40201
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40203
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40204
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    40205
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40202 1 40202
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40203
Name     Quan-Jang's Study~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Star charts cover every wall of this cluttered, book-lined study,
overlapping in a dense weave of ink and annotation. A single chair
sits before a broad worktable, worn smooth at the edges from long
use. Whatever Quan-Jang is working on here, it clearly consumes most
of his waking hours.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40202
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40201 1 40203
Reset O 0 40202 3 40203
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40204
Name     Alchemy Laboratory~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Rows of workbenches fill this room, each cluttered with vials,
burners, and carefully labeled reagents. A faint, not entirely
pleasant chemical smell hangs in the air, and a chalkboard along one
wall is covered in half-erased notation.
~
#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    40202
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40206
#ENDEXIT

Reset O 0 40201 5 40204
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40205
Name     Archive Annex~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Shelves rise floor to ceiling here, packed with bound records
and older, stranger media that predate paper entirely. This annex
holds Anil Kesh's own findings - overflow from Kaleth's larger
archive, kept close at hand for easy reference.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40202
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40203 1 40205
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40206
Name     Testing Chamber~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Scorch marks and worse stains mark the walls of this reinforced
chamber, set apart from the rest of the laboratory for obvious
reasons. Whatever gets tested here, it isn't always predictable.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40204
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40207
Name     Observation Deck~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Wide windows, ground and polished by hand, look out over the
Chasm and the stars beyond. Several instruments here point outward
rather than in - Anil Kesh's scholars study the sky as readily as they
study the Force.
~
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    40208
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40208
Name     Chasm-Edge Walk~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     A narrow, railed walkway clings to the inside of the Chasm's
upper wall, Anil Kesh's foundations rising overhead. The drop below
is lost in shadow long before it ends. Few linger here longer than
they have to.
~
#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    40201
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40207
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ENDAREA
